WEBVTT

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.000
Have you ever played a game that made you think,

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.933
remember and smile every time you got a match?

00:00:10.133 --> 00:00:12.067
Well, what if I told you that you could

00:00:12.067 --> 00:00:15.067
build a game like that yourself?

00:00:15.133 --> 00:00:20.267
Yes! You are about to become a game creator.

00:00:21.233 --> 00:00:24.033
Together, we are going to build Number Match:

00:00:24.033 --> 00:00:26.733
a fun memory game where you turn over cards,

00:00:26.733 --> 00:00:30.400
find matching numbers and challenge your memory.

00:00:30.667 --> 00:00:33.167
And the most exciting part?

00:00:33.167 --> 00:00:37.367
You will create it yourself, one step at a time!

00:00:38.667 --> 00:00:40.733
We will start with HTML,

00:00:40.733 --> 00:00:44.233
the language that gives our game its structure.

00:00:44.267 --> 00:00:46.933
Then we will use CSS to make our cards

00:00:46.933 --> 00:00:50.433
colourful, beautiful and exciting.

00:00:50.467 --> 00:00:55.267
Finally, we will use JavaScript to make everything work.

00:00:56.233 --> 00:00:59.133
And guess where we will build everything?

00:00:59.133 --> 00:01:04.100
Right here, inside the Paisley Studio coding environment.

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:08.700
Get ready, because you are not just going to play a game.

00:01:08.700 --> 00:01:11.667
You are going to create one!
